:''This enemy's official name is unknown.''
'''5th Anniversary Dummy''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in [[Five Year Plan]]. It was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 5th Anniversary Dummy
|image = E 378.png
|appearance = [[Arena of Honor/Five Year Plan|Five Year Plan]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy base can attack Cat Units in range with a slow attack rate. Because it is a base, it does not move, similar to the [[Sunrise Doge|Sun Doge]] and [[Ritual Drum Doge]]. Its attacks are instant-kill, although [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]] and [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] can survive due to having the [[Metal|Metal Ability]], and cats with [[Survive]] can too. Like other bases, it is immune to most negative effects.

